        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this three-bedroom mid-terrace property to the market, ideally positioned on the ever-popular Cappagh Road, Finglas, Dublin 11. No. 203 extends to c. 98 sq.m and comes to the market in need of full refurbishment and modernisation throughout. Offering generous living accommodation, a large rear garden and vacant possession, this property presents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors and builders looking for a property with plenty of potential.\n\nThe location is second to none, situated within easy reach of Finglas Village, Charlestown Shopping Centre and Clearwater Shopping Centre, with an abundance of local amenities including reputable schools, shops, parks and sporting facilities all close by. The area is well serviced by public transport with numerous bus routes providing access to Dublin City Centre, while the M50 and N2 road networks are within minutes, providing swift access throughout Dublin and beyond.\n\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation of c. 98 sq.m comprises of entrance hallway, living room, dining room, kitchen, three bedrooms and main family bathroom. No. 203 benefits from gas fired central heating with a new gas boiler and is offered to the market with vacant possession. Externally, there is a garden to the front while the rear boasts a large and particularly long garden, providing excellent outdoor space and further adding to the potential on offer.\n\nAlthough requiring refurbishment throughout, the generous proportions, three-bedroom layout and substantial rear garden provide an excellent foundation for its next owner to create a superb family home. No. 203 is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers and early interest is expected.\n\nContact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 0868323302 or 015411455 for further information or to arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures\nc. 98 sq.m\nBER E\nMid-terrace property\nGas fired central heating\nNew gas boiler\nVacant possession\nIn need of full refurbishment\nExcellent potential\nSpacious living accommodation\nLarge, long rear garden\nMature residential location\nFinglas Village close by\nCharlestown and Clearwater Shopping Centres within easy reach\nExcellent transport links\nM50 and N2 within easy reach\nDublin City Centre easily accessible\nIdeal for first-time buyers, investors and builders\nViewing highly advised"
      },
